@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+---
+id: task-001-discount-codes-on-orders
+type: task
+title: "Discount codes on orders"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Request
+
+Let an order take a discount code for the spring campaign.
+
+- `SPRING10`: 10 % off the order's items, rounded to the nearest cent (half a cent rounds up).
+- `WELCOME5`: 5.00 € off the items, only when the items come to 30.00 € or more.
+- One code per order at most; a second code replaces the first.
+- An unknown code, or `WELCOME5` on a smaller order, is refused with an error saying why; the order is unchanged.
+- Shipping is never discounted; free shipping is decided on the items before any discount.
+- API: `applyCode(orderNumber, code)` on the order book; totals gain `discountCents` (0 without a code);
+  `totalCents` = items - discount + shipping.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+Tests in `test/shop.test.ts` cover each rule above; `npm test` passes. CHANGELOG and README updated.
